# --- PostHog capture layer (SPEC-008) — all optional / env-gated ---
# When these are ABSENT the portal compiles and runs with zero analytics
# (PostHogProvider is a no-op; server chat capture is skipped).
# Client SDK (browser). Public project key (phc_...). Enables autocapture +
# masked session replay + cookieless 'memory' persistence.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
# PostHog ingest host. US cloud default: https://us.i.posthog.com (EU:
# https://eu.i.posthog.com). Used by both the browser SDK and server capture.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
# Optional escape hatch: set to "always" or "on_reject" to enable PostHog's
# fully server-side-hashed cookieless mode on pure-public surfaces. Leave BLANK
# behind the Clerk gate — "always" disables identify() and session replay.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_COOKIELESS_MODE=
# Server SDK (posthog-node). PostHog *project* ingest key (same value as
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY). Gates server-side chat-transcript capture in
# api/chat. If blank, the [AUDIT] log-only behavior is preserved unchanged.
POSTHOG_KEY=
# Steward runner ONLY (not read by the portal): PostHog personal API key
# (phx_...) for agent read/query access. Not used by any portal code.
POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY=
